WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.281
Localcode

00:00:01.447 --> 00:00:02.684
open source agentic

00:00:02.496 --> 00:00:03.250
coding on your

00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:03.663
Mac

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:05.479
Localcode is an

00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:06.634
open source agentic

00:00:06.446 --> 00:00:07.401
coding tool for

00:00:07.213 --> 00:00:08.238
the Mac that

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.733
runs with a

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:09.759
single command

00:00:10.294 --> 00:00:11.331
Choose from 12

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.242
models and 169

00:00:13.053 --> 00:00:14.067
quant options for

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:14.539
