00:00:14.728 --> 00:00:16.036
image input and

00:00:15.884 --> 00:00:17.039
typed decisions

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:18.581
LocalCode recommends

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.524
the most capable

00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:20.385
