00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.036
Speed

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:25.428
Gemma 4 Qwen

00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:27.350
3.6 Muse Glimmer

00:00:27.185 --> 00:00:28.670
and Qwen 3.8

00:00:28.482 --> 00:00:29.661
draft tokens with

00:00:29.473 --> 00:00:30.486
the vendor's own

00:00:30.298 --> 00:00:31.642
speculative drafter

00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:32.869
which downloads with

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:33.387
the model

